  "description": "Why Pay $149 For A Single Indicator 😵‍💫",
  "body_html": "<p><strong>Want to see where smart money is flowing next?</strong><br>This custom screener tracks <strong>247 hand-picked stocks</strong> between $10B–$100B market cap — a sweet spot for explosive growth and institutional accumulation.</p><p>✅ Every stock on this list is <strong>above its 200-day moving average</strong>, showing long-term strength.<br>✅ The ones below just triggered a <strong>pivot breakout</strong> on <strong>above-average volume</strong> — a classic sign of <strong>buying pressure</strong> from big players.<br>✅ And they’re ranked by <strong>relative strength</strong>, so you only see the top contenders — no noise, no fluff.</p>",
